# Overmind materialization mirrors and ceremony pins are machine state, never
# repo content: BACKLOG/ + ENTRIES/ are rewritten mirrors of the board,
# .overmind/ holds per-worktree project pins. Protected here (not just in the
# local .git/info/exclude) so no clone can accidentally commit them.
BACKLOG/
ENTRIES/
.overmind/
